tools.description:
Ask the user one or more structured questions before continuing. Submit all questions in one call and wait for all answers together. Do not call ask_user in parallel with any other tool.

Critical schema rules:
- Every option must contain both a non-empty `label` and `value`. Never omit `value`. If the business context does not provide one, generate a unique stable machine-readable value such as `historical_adaptation`.
- `single_select` and `multi_select` questions must contain `options`.
- `form` fields currently support only `single_select`; every field must contain `options`.
- `style_cards` applies only to `single_select`; every option must contain `desc` and an HTTPS `coverUrl`. Otherwise use `presentation: "list"`.
- Use the exact field names `questionId`, `fieldId`, `desc`, and `coverUrl`.

Example:
{
  "title": "诺曼底登陆短片 - 创作规格确认",
  "desc": "请确认历史题材处理方式、画幅比例和叙事焦点。",
  "questions": [
    {
      "questionId": "production_spec",
      "type": "form",
      "title": "技术规格确认",
      "required": true,
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldId": "aspect_ratio",
          "type": "single_select",
          "label": "画幅比例",
          "required": true,
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "16:9（推荐）",
              "value": "ratio_16_9",
              "desc": "经典电影宽银幕比例，适合战争史诗题材。"
            },
            {
              "label": "21:9",
              "value": "ratio_21_9",
              "desc": "超宽银幕比例，适合强化沉浸感和史诗感。"
            },
            {
              "label": "4:3",
              "value": "ratio_4_3",
              "desc": "传统电视和纪录片比例，更接近历史影像资料的观感。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "questionId": "history_mode",
      "type": "single_select",
      "title": "历史题材处理模式",
      "desc": "请选择对历史真实性和戏剧化程度的要求。",
      "required": true,
      "presentation": "list",
      "allowCustom": false,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "历史改编（推荐）",
          "value": "historical_adaptation",
          "desc": "核心事件、时间线和军事装备符合历史，人物对白与具体情节可以虚构。"
        },
        {
          "label": "严格史实",
          "value": "strict_history",
          "desc": "所有事件、人物、装备和战术均需要有史料依据。"
        },
        {
          "label": "灵感启发",
          "value": "inspired_by_history",
          "desc": "借用诺曼底登陆的背景设定，人物和情节可以完全虚构。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "questionId": "scene_elements",
      "type": "multi_select",
      "title": "场景元素",
      "desc": "可以选择多个元素。",
      "required": false,
      "presentation": "list",
      "minSelections": 1,
      "maxSelections": 4,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "登陆艇",
          "value": "landing_craft",
          "desc": "展现士兵乘坐登陆艇接近海滩的场面。"
        },
        {
          "label": "战机编队",
          "value": "aircraft_formation",
          "desc": "展现盟军飞机对海岸防线进行空中支援。"
        },
        {
          "label": "海岸炮台",
          "value": "coastal_battery",
          "desc": "展现德军海岸防御工事和炮火压制。"
        },
        {
          "label": "医疗救援",
          "value": "medical_rescue",
          "desc": "展现战场医疗兵救助伤员的情节。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

